-- R2 (V10-5): photos a merge did NOT move. Live merge_into_primary (sim_merge) moves a duplicate's photo to the survivor
-- stamped merged_from, except a photo whose file the survivor already holds, which stays on the merged-away row; and a
-- photo already on the survivor is never stamped. V1 is merged into V3; then unmerged (sim_unmerge = live unmerge_vehicle).
--   PA: filed on V3 from the start (survivor's own photo); a pass names V1 (its VIN, say).
--   PB: filed on V1, its file already on V3 (twin PB2), so it STAYS on V1; a pass names the survivor V3.
--   PM: filed on V1, moved by the merge (control: the v10 fix's case); a pass names V3.
